     <P> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">2016</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">学年绍兴一中青年教师课堂教学能力比武与展示活动方案</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Cambria> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体"><FONT size=3>一、指导思想<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">课堂是学科教学的主阵地，课堂教学能力是教师教书育人的核心能力。为此，为进一步提升学校青年教师的课堂教学能力，进而提高教育教学质量，根据学校工作计划，决定举行</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>2016</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">学年青年教师课堂教学比武与展示活动。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体"><FONT size=3>二、目标与主题<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.99"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">活动目标：</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">本次活动以课堂教学为载体，以课堂比武为平台，通过课堂的研讨达成以下三项目标：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>1. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">以评促学：通过对课堂教学设计与实施的探索和研磨，进一步完善教师教学行为，提高课堂教学的有效性。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>2. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">以评带训：以课堂的比武与展示深入推进学科校本研训，通过教师个体与教师群体相结合的课堂探索与磨课研究，开展学科问题的交流与沟通，促成学科教师的共同进步。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>3. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">以评择优：通过课堂的比武与展示，让一批能全面适应课程改革、学科专业功底厚实且学科教学效果优的青年教师脱颖而出。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.99"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">活动主题：</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">求真视野下的学科生本课堂教学探索</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体"><FONT size=3>三、工作组<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">组</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Cambria>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">长：朱雯</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN><o:p></o:p></FONT></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">成</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Cambria>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">员：陈银伟、卢燎亚、宣方军、俞建种、戴军熔、相关处室领导及名师工作室导师、各学科主任与备课组长</SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: red; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">              </SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体"><FONT size=3>四、阶段安排<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">（一）组内评比：</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">学科组推优阶段（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>2016</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">12</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">月<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>日——<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>日</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>1. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">参赛对象：各学科组三年内青年教师（共</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>34</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">位教师，名单见附件</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">）及自愿报名或组内推荐的老师。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>2.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">各学科主任按照学科组推优阶段的安排时间，在</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>14</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">日（星期三）之前向课程处上报学科组相关老师的具体上课时间、内容、班级及地点。（具体见附件</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>3. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">各学科主任应组织并扎实抓好组内青年教师汇报课的听课和评课活动，务实开展以磨课、听课、议课、评课等形式为载体的课堂深度研讨。各学科组应在一轮听课结束后组织开展一次深度的评课、研课活动。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>4. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">在无课时冲突的情况下，组内其他教师应积极参与比武课的听课活动。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>5. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">各学科主任牵头做好一轮比武课的评审，在此基础上推荐出参加校级课堂教学比武活动的人选，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>12</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>31</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">日之前将所有参加组内赛课教师的《课堂教学评估表》（一人一表）上报课程处。（具体见附件</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Cambria>6. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Cambria; mso-ascii-font-family: Cambria">各学科组评委安排如下：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P>
<TABLE class=MsoNormalTable style="BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext" cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 border=1>
<TBODY>
<TR style="mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes">
